            "notes": "Grab  [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) here because it will be the main part of our build to help us build rally early and make use of  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) which is pretty good with this build later on with how much ults you can pump out.\n\n [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) is also good because you'll be wanting to use your abilities alot, the other perk is up to you and your preference, if you wanna be tankier take  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) , but if you wanna get more value from your melee take either  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)",
