            "notes": "[Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c) makes you start off with 50% ult charge in association with  [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) making  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) even easier to get.\n\nBesides this the perks are optional to your scenario, if a winston or pharah is beaming you with their weapons take  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) but if not just grab more  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) in either  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) or  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)  depending on how much you can afford",
