            "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:53:34.97405+00:00",
            "notes": "[Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) is grabbed here cause we gotta get that mitigated damage UPPP, and also it just goes well with  [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) and an upcoming perk we'll grab in round 5.\n\nWe grab  [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) here because well, we want ult more don't we, spam alot of bashes and whipshots into the enemy and we're set.\n\nIf you've the money to spare and you're winning just go all out on  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and ultimate generation in  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) , or a cheeky  [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) if you really wanna mess over a  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) or  [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) \n\nThe other optionals are just to up your  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) to give you a reason to fight, along with  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)\n\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you really wanna be a pain, but now we're being greedy.",
