            "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:53:35.525765+00:00",
            "notes": "You know the deal, play with your tank and farm ult charge up front and be scary. Just don't over extend too much with your tank, you still want to be in arms length of your support.\n\nAlso you may be wondering now, how does this build counter  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) . Now picture this, reaper's going to tp into your backline, feast on your support then BOOM. Rally, he's stunned, he's in a pickle, he has to get out. Your rally's down, he thinks he can strike, he's going in for the kill. BOOM! bashed and whipshotted  [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) gives your teammate overhealth so they can recover.\n\nIf played right, this build can RUIN a  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) , [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) and  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) .",
