            "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:53:36.076278+00:00",
            "notes": "[Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) is good if you want to get more value from  [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) and of course my go to.\n\nBut if you don't like the sound of that,  [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) is good to get more ult charge, along with  [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) as it hits multiple people at once, same can be said for  [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) but I really wouldn't choose it or recommend it to you.\n\n[Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) is good if survivability is your issue but i Wouldn't worry too much with how much rallies you could be pumping out.\n\nI'm going to be honest if you've made it this far and you can't afford  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) , I apologize but maybe lock in, I'm sorry.  \n\n[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) may be low but you should be pumping out rallies every other fight so that really shouldn't be your concern. other becoming a brick wall in the battle field, stunning all your enemies, play forward with your tank, farm rallies and hold the point to the best of your ability, don't be afraid to shield bash out of there.",
